      "writtenOn": "2021-11-10T22:45:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think py3wrapper.sh is part of the Python toolchain of Bazel, so the aquery output of a py_binary target should not include it. But I don\u0027t think it is really needed for a py_binary target since the stub script already requires a specific version of Python interpreter.\n\nb/205879240 is created for this.",
