        "id": 1605027
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-10T23:29:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unless you can find documentation of guarantees of the ordering of aquery, we would be best served making no such assumptions. Even if actions are topologically sorted today, there may not be guarantees that Bazel won\u0027t change this moving forward. And, with the given code, this failure would be *quite* difficult to debug.",
      "parentUuid": "1aeee788_eb5693a3",
      "revId": "79c5a24ae7e8f39e310e35577502718e539cfc8c",
